				"create `tasks/adapters-optimization/README.md` with: where discovery docs live, required discovery sections (baseline per draft + failing tests list), and the rule: after every discovery story, add 1–3 new one-iteration implementation stories into `prd.jsonc` directly after the discovery story, renumbering ids to stay sequential",
